Verification Link Expired

Hi there,

The verification link you tried to use has expired or is no longer valid.

For security reasons, verification links expire after a set period of time.

What to do next:
- Return to the application and request a new verification email
- Check your inbox for the new verification link
- Complete the verification process within the time limit

If you continue to experience issues, please contact our support team.

